For control, we exploit the fact that the GN is differentiable to use our learned forward and inference models for model-based planning within a classic, gradient-based trajectory optimization regime, also known as model-predictive control (MPC). We also develop an agent which simultaneously learns a GN-based model and policy function via Stochastic Value Gradients (SVG) \cite{heess2015learning}.
%
